  "question": "1) Background / Context\nThe project involves working with a dataset of funding grants provided by the National Science Foundation (NSF). The primary focus is to analyze this data to predict the award amounts for research grants, thereby assisting in decision-making processes.\n\n 2) Objectives\n- Develop a system that predicts award amounts for NSF grants.\n- Use historical grant data to aid in accurate forecasting.\n- Facilitate data analysis to improve grant management and decision-making.\n\n 3) Stakeholders & Users\n- Primary Users: Data analysts, NSF grant officers, research institutions.\n- Stakeholders: National Science Foundation, research applicants, policy makers.\n\n 4) Functional Descriptions\n- Data Management: Ingest and manage grant data, including details about awards, investigators, institutions, and program elements.\n- Prediction Engine: Develop algorithms to predict award amounts based on historical data.\n- Reporting: Generate detailed reports for insights into award distribution and trends.\n- User Interface: Provide a UI for users to input data queries and view prediction outcomes.\n\n 5) Non-Functional Descriptions\n- Performance: The system should handle large volumes of data with efficient querying capabilities.\n- Scalability: Handle increases in data size without loss of performance as more historical data becomes available.\n- Security: Ensure data privacy and secure access to sensitive grant and applicant information.\n- Usability: User interfaces must be intuitive and accessible for users with varying levels of expertise in data analysis.",
  "ddl": "-- Schema for database: schemabench_0110\nCREATE TABLE `institutions` (\n  `institution_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `institution_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `city` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `state` varchar(100) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `country` varchar(100) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`institution_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `program_elements` (\n  `program_element_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `element_code` varchar(50) NOT NULL,\n  `element_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `description` text DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`program_element_id`),\n  UNIQUE KEY `element_code` (`element_code`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `grants` (\n  `grant_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `award_number` varchar(50) NOT NULL,\n  `title` varchar(500) NOT NULL,\n  `abstract` text DEFAULT NULL,\n  `award_amount` decimal(15,2) NOT NULL,\n  `award_start_date` date DEFAULT NULL,\n  `award_end_date` date DEFAULT NULL,\n  `fiscal_year` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `institution_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `program_element_id` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `award_type` varchar(100) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`grant_id`),\n  UNIQUE KEY `award_number` (`award_number`),\n  KEY `institution_id` (`institution_id`),\n  KEY `program_element_id` (`program_element_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `grants_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`institution_id`) REFERENCES `institutions` (`institution_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `grants_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`program_element_id`) REFERENCES `program_elements` (`program_element_id`) ON DELETE SET NULL ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `investigators` (\n  `investigator_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `first_name` varchar(100) NOT NULL,\n  `last_name` varchar(100) NOT NULL,\n  `email` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `institution_id` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`investigator_id`),\n  KEY `institution_id` (`institution_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `investigators_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`institution_id`) REFERENCES `institutions` (`institution_id`) ON DELETE SET NULL ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `grant_investigators` (\n  `grant_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `investigator_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `role` varchar(100) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `is_primary` tinyint(1) NOT NULL DEFAULT '0',\n  PRIMARY KEY (`grant_id`,`investigator_id`),\n  KEY `investigator_id` (`investigator_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `grant_investigators_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`grant_id`) REFERENCES `grants` (`grant_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `grant_investigators_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`investigator_id`) REFERENCES `investigators` (`investigator_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `award_predictions` (\n  `prediction_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `grant_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `predicted_award_amount` decimal(15,2) NOT NULL,\n  `model_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `model_version` varchar(100) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `predicted_at` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `actual_award_amount` decimal(15,2) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `prediction_error` decimal(15,2) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`prediction_id`),\n  KEY `grant_id` (`grant_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `award_predictions_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`grant_id`) REFERENCES `grants` (`grant_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;",
